以下是優化後、結構更清晰、可讀性更好且更適合調查用途的版本：
1. 主查詢（找出 TS_CUST_ID 有超過 6 個 SK_CUST_ID 的客戶）
-- 找出有多重 SK_CUST_ID 的 TS_CUST_ID（重點關注 >6 個的情況）
SELECT 
    bscf.* 
FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT bscf
WHERE bscf.CUSTOMERNO IN (
    SELECT DISTINCT s.TS_CUST_ID
    FROM (
        SELECT 
            TS_CUST_ID,
            COUNT(DISTINCT SK_CUST_ID) AS SK_COUNT
        FROM BANCS_SK_CUST_INFO
        GROUP BY TS_CUST_ID
        HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT SK_CUST_ID) > 6          -- 可依需求調整為 >= 2 或其他門檻
    ) t
    JOIN BANCS_SK_CUST_INFO s ON t.TS_CUST_ID = s.TS_CUST_ID
)
AND bscf.IsSARFiled != '0'
ORDER BY bscf.CUSTOMERNO;
2. 單筆客戶詳細資訊（建議一起看）
-- 查詢特定 TS_CUST_ID 的所有 SK 對應資料
SELECT 
    TS_CUST_ID,
    SK_CUST_ID,
    COUNT(*) OVER (PARTITION BY TS_CUST_ID) AS SK_COUNT_PER_TS,
    * 
FROM BANCS_SK_CUST_INFO 
WHERE TS_CUST_ID = 'L2876734180'
ORDER BY SK_CUST_ID;
3. Migrate Buffer 關聯查詢（優化後）
-- 查看 Migrate Buffer 中的相關資料
SELECT 
    c.*,
    np.* 
FROM Customer_Migrate_buffer c
LEFT JOIN Cust_NP_Migrate_buffer np 
    ON c.CIF_KEY = np.CIF_KEY
WHERE c.customerNo IN (
    'L287673418',
    'L287673418C',
    'L287673418D',
    'L287673418E',
    'L287673418F',
    'L287673418G',
    'L287673418H'
)
ORDER BY c.customerNo, c.CIF_KEY;
4. SAR 狀態確認
-- 確認 SAR 申報狀態
SELECT 
    customerNo,
    IsSARFiled,
    COUNT(*) OVER (PARTITION BY customerNo) AS duplicate_count
FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT 
WHERE customerNo = 'L2876734180';

額外建議（調查用綜合版本）
如果你想一次看完整圖像，可以用下面這個組合查詢：
-- 綜合調查單一 TS_CUST_ID
DECLARE @TargetTS VARCHAR(20) = 'L2876734180';

-- 1. SK 重複情況
SELECT 
    TS_CUST_ID,
    COUNT(DISTINCT SK_CUST_ID) AS SK_COUNT,
    STRING_AGG(SK_CUST_ID, ', ') AS SK_LIST
FROM BANCS_SK_CUST_INFO 
WHERE TS_CUST_ID = @TargetTS
GROUP BY TS_CUST_ID;

-- 2. BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT 資料
SELECT * FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT 
WHERE CUSTOMERNO = @TargetTS;

-- 3. Migrate Buffer
SELECT * FROM Customer_Migrate_buffer 
WHERE customerNo LIKE @TargetTS + '%';
優化重點：
	•	使用有意義的別名（bscf, t, s）
	•	加上 ORDER BY 方便閱讀
	•	使用 STRING_AGG 快速看到所有 SK_CUST_ID
	•	加上視窗函數顯示 count
	•	使用變數方便重複執行
